            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Personally, I would really like to get a v1.52.1 out that either moves #7757's sharded blocking inject to an unstable opt-in `runtime::Builder` setting for now, or reverts the change entirely, as I'd really like to be able to pick up #8010 without having the regression...",
